      "segments": [
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0000.wav",
          "timeline_start": 0.6,
          "timeline_end": 4.0173,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "谁懂啊，死了三年的白月光回来了，还挽着亲哥，等你当众喊大嫂。",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_duck_end": 4.03,
          "source_restore_at": 4.08,
          "source_handoff_status": "sentence_boundary",
          "source_entry_status": "sentence_boundary"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0001.wav",
          "timeline_start": 5.773,
          "timeline_end": 9.7238,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "她改名方牧兰，嘴上装作不认识，一个眼神就把三年前的旧情全招了。",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_duck_end": 10.5,
          "source_restore_at": 10.55,
          "source_handoff_status": "sentence_boundary",
          "source_entry_status": "sentence_boundary"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0002.wav",
          "timeline_start": 23.047,
          "timeline_end": 26.3128,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "天呐，狠话还没落地，下一秒两个人直接亲上了。",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_duck_end": 28.003,
          "source_restore_at": 28.053,
          "source_handoff_status": "sentence_boundary",
          "source_entry_status": "sentence_boundary"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0003.wav",
          "timeline_start": 28.053,
          "timeline_end": 31.2969,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "前脚还装陌生人，看他挨打，她想都没想就冲过去挡下。",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_duck_end": 32.06,
          "source_restore_at": 32.11,
          "source_handoff_status": "sentence_boundary",
          "source_entry_status": "sentence_boundary"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0004.wav",
          "timeline_start": 38.2,
          "timeline_end": 41.9376,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "嘴上装不认识，见他挨打却下意识冲去护着，这一下伪装露馅，男主全懂了。",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_entry_status": "sentence_boundary"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0005.wav",
          "timeline_start": 42.573,
          "timeline_end": 45.4415,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "偏偏再见面，她已经穿上婚服，要嫁给他哥。",
          "overlaps_speech": true
        },
        {
          "source_path": "MEDIA_NOT_DISTRIBUTED/_placed_0006.wav",
          "timeline_start": 46.74,
          "timeline_end": 51.0257,
          "gain": 1.0,
          "text": "她忙着复仇，他追着真相。前任变大嫂，家人们，这瓜谁能不迷糊？",
          "overlaps_speech": true,
          "source_duck_end": 51.45,
          "source_restore_at": 51.5,
          "source_handoff_status": "sentence_boundary"
        }
      ]
    },
